  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Women Seeking Justice and Peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at; Implementation and follow up of UNSCR 1325 and the gender provisions of the Rome Statute from the local level in Mali and Colombia to the global leve. Increased participation, competence and influence of women from conflict and post- conflict situations in peace and justice processes at the global level. Increased space for women, human rights advocates and civil society groups to strategically engage and influence relevant institutional stakeholders</narrative>
  </description>
